  <p id="c-nanqishu-054-mingshanbin-yuanlin:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">永明元年，世祖敕召<persName id="c-nanqishu-054-mingshanbin-yuanlin:p001:m0009" ref="nbb_y6s_bfz_AA">僧紹</persName>，稱疾不肯見。詔徵國子博士，不就，卒。子<persName id="c-nanqishu-054-mingshanbin-yuanlin:p001:m0031" ref="nbb_y6s_bfz_AAB">元琳</persName>，字<persName id="c-nanqishu-054-mingshanbin-yuanlin:p001:m0035" ref="nbb_y6s_bfz_AAB">仲璋</persName>，亦傳家業。</p>
